    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the wilderness and protect your calf and your herd from lurking predators and the looming threat of starvation. Make your way through the open landscapes as a majestic elephant.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About <strong>Shelter 3</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With so many mouths to feed, your journey will be a hard one. Use ancient knowledge to navigate through the world and discover new terrain and untrodden pathways, gaining wisdom as you do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be aware that you will need to make hard choices along the way. In the wild, all living creatures are put to the test and as an elephant, you\u2019re not a predator but prey.  Be alert and gather your herd during times of danger. Your herd is your family, shelter is your only hope, and survival your only goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Different Kind of Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shelter 3 is a game where wisdom, empathy and leadership play an important role in your survival. Like its forebears, Shelter 3 invites you to inhabit the spirit of an animal. But where Shelter 2 centred on a lone lynx family, Shelter 3 lets you explore a different kind of animal existence as an elephant, where community is as important as family, and unity is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Landscapes and fauna are rendered in mesmerising patterns and scored with an enchanting soundtrack by Retro Family, conjuring a magical world to lose yourself in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This new Shelter incarnation migrates to new territory and offers a new, magical experience that you won\u2019t forget.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the wilderness and protect your calf and your herd from lurking predators and the looming threat of starvation. Make your way through the open landscapes as a majestic elephant.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About <strong>Shelter 3</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With so many mouths to feed, your journey will be a hard one. Use ancient knowledge to navigate through the world and discover new terrain and untrodden pathways, gaining wisdom as you do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be aware that you will need to make hard choices along the way. In the wild, all living creatures are put to the test and as an elephant, you\u2019re not a predator but prey.  Be alert and gather your herd during times of danger. Your herd is your family, shelter is your only hope, and survival your only goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Different Kind of Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shelter 3 is a game where wisdom, empathy and leadership play an important role in your survival. Like its forebears, Shelter 3 invites you to inhabit the spirit of an animal. But where Shelter 2 centred on a lone lynx family, Shelter 3 lets you explore a different kind of animal existence as an elephant, where community is as important as family, and unity is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Landscapes and fauna are rendered in mesmerising patterns and scored with an enchanting soundtrack by Retro Family, conjuring a magical world to lose yourself in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This new Shelter incarnation migrates to new territory and offers a new, magical experience that you won\u2019t forget.</p>",
